---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import DraftBanner from '../components/DraftBanner.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookies | Kumar Ashutosh"
  description="Draft cookie notice: this site sets no cookies today, and lists the consent categories planned if analytics or advertising are added."
  canonicalPath="/cookies/"
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container page-narrow legal">
    <DraftBanner />
    <p class="section-tag">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Cookies</h1>

    <h2>Today</h2>
    <p>This site sets no cookies of its own, and there is no consent banner. Its analytics tool, Plausible Analytics, does not use cookies.</p>

    <h2>Planned categories</h2>
    <p>Not active today. If either is added, a consent banner would be added with it.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Analytics: Google Analytics 4, to understand which writing is useful.</li>
      <li>Advertising: Google AdSense, to help cover running costs.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>See the <a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> for more.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
